Tables Table 3-1: Selected Internal Information Sources ...................................................................... 7 Table 3-2: Handling Recommendations for Selected Types of Sensitive Data .........................12 Table 3-3: Traffic Light Protocol, Version 1.0 ...........................................................................15', 'kb-doc-nist-800-150-p8-1', 0, 265, 'nist-sp-800-150', 'Final', '9CE5CD8AEED4C25C8D84F9FAAC53F60C429BE4F39B8873E8BC12E5DB52B8B5D6', 'v1', '{"source_id": "nist-sp-800-150", "version": "Final", "corpus_version": "v1", "batch": "batch-001"}')
