VALUES ('doc-nist-800-86-p71-2', 'doc-nist-800-86', '', 71, '105 In most organizations, the cost of redundant monitoring makes it feasible only for the highest risk areas. 106 Helpful references for analysts include lists of commonly used protocols and their typical port numbers, and Request for Comment (RFC) documents that explain the standards for various network and application protocols. 6-11', 'kb-doc-nist-800-86-p71-2', 0, 51, 'nist-sp-800-86', 'Final', '2F770C1F01CE58C19C8424D1F7C557C2F0DD8100F3B47B7B1B3B13D65730309C', 'v1', '{"source_id": "nist-sp-800-86", "version": "Final", "corpus_version": "v1", "batch": "batch-001"}')
